# Deep-Guard Fix — 2026-07-10T20:05:47+03:30
# File: /tmp/dvna/core/appHandler.js  Line: 246  Severity: high
# Type: xss

## Root Cause
The application renders user-controlled messages directly to the response without sanitization, allowing for potential XSS attacks.

## Explanation
The patch ensures that the message is properly escaped using a library function before rendering it in the response. This prevents any HTML or script tags in the user-controlled message from being executed in the browser, mitigating the XSS risk.

## Patch
--- a/tmp/dvna/core/appHandler.js
+++ b/tmp/dvna/core/appHandler.js
@@ -245,6 +245,7 @@
       res.redirect('/app/products')
     }else{
-      res.render('app/bulkproducts',{messages:{danger:'Invalid file'},legacy:false})
+      res.render('app/bulkproducts',{messages:{danger: escapeHtml('Invalid file')},legacy:false})
     }
   }
 }

